# .cursorrules - lagniconsulting.ca homepage redesign

## Project
- Site: lagniconsulting.ca (business consulting firm based in Cotonou, Benin)
- Page: Homepage only (3 design variants in 1 HTML file)
- Stack: HTML5 + vanilla CSS (NO frameworks, NO Tailwind, NO Bootstrap)
- Output: Single HTML file with 3 distinct variants, clearly separated

## ⚠️ CRITICAL: LOGO MUST NOT CHANGE
- **Logo file**: Use EXACT same logo in all 3 variants
- **Logo path**: `/assets/images/logo.png` (or .svg if available)
- **Logo dimensions**: Do NOT resize, recolor, or modify the logo
- **Logo placement**: Top-left in header/navigation (consistent across variants)
- **Logo alt text**: "Lagni Consulting"
- **If logo has transparent background**: Keep it (do not add white box behind)
- **If logo has specific colors**: Do NOT apply CSS filters or color changes
- **NEVER generate a new logo or suggest logo changes**

## Design Principles
- **Style**: Premium consulting, minimal, sophisticated
- **Color palette**:
  - Primary: Navy (#0A192F)
  - Accent: Gold (#D4AF37)
  - Neutrals: White (#FFFFFF), Light Gray (#F5F5F5), Dark Gray (#333333)
- **Typography**:
  - Max 2 fonts total
  - Headings: Playfair Display (serif, elegant)
  - Body: Inter (sans-serif, clean, readable)
  - Import from Google Fonts
- **Spacing**: Generous whitespace (2x-3x default margins/padding)
- **Layout**: Clean grid, clear hierarchy, mobile-first responsive
- **Imagery**: Professional, business-oriented (use Unsplash placeholders)

## Technical Requirements
- Semantic HTML5 (header, nav, main, section, footer)
- CSS custom properties (variables) for colors, fonts, spacing
- Each variant uses unique class prefix: `.design1-`, `.design2-`, `.design3-`
- Mobile responsive (media queries for <768px)
- Accessibility: proper contrast ratios, focus states, semantic structure
- Performance: minimal CSS, no external dependencies except Google Fonts

## Output Format
- Single HTML file only
- 3 variants separated by comments: `<!-- DESIGN 1 -->`, `<!-- DESIGN 2 -->`, `<!-- DESIGN 3 -->`
- Each variant is a complete, standalone homepage with:
  - Header with logo (SAME logo in all variants)
  - Hero section (headline, subheadline, CTA)
  - Services section (3-4 cards)
  - About section (brief intro + photo placeholder)
  - Testimonials (2-3 quotes)
  - Contact section (form + contact info)
  - Footer (logo repeated, links, copyright)
- No explanations in output, just the HTML code

## Design Variant Specifications
- **Design 1**: Dark theme (navy background hero, gold accents, bold typography)
- **Design 2**: Light theme (white background, soft shadows, elegant serif headings)
- **Design 3**: Minimalist (lots of white space, accent color gold, ultra-clean layout)

## Logo Implementation Example
```html
<!-- CORRECT: Logo stays identical -->
<header class="design1-header">
  <img src="/assets/images/logo.png" alt="Lagni Consulting" class="logo">
</header>

<!-- WRONG: Do NOT do this -->
<header class="design1-header">
  <img src="/assets/images/logo.png" alt="Lagni Consulting" class="logo" style="filter: brightness(0) invert(1);">
</header>
```
